        {"zh": "眼皮越来越沉，你还得盯着", "en": "Your lids grow heavy, yet you must keep watching."},
        {"zh": "我盯着你，你别移开眼。", "en": "I hold your gaze; do not look away."},
        {"zh": "光里浮起一层灰影", "en": "A grey shape surfaces in the light."},
        {"zh": "它把视线挪到你握剑的手", "en": "It shifts its gaze to your sword hand."},
        {"zh": "你背后的永饿在靠近", "en": "The Eternal Hunger behind you draws near."}
      ]
