        {"zh": "眼睛从地底探出！", "en": "Eyes protruding from the ground."},
        {"zh": "它们在注视着你！", "en": "They are watching you."},
        {"zh": "警惕，视觉神经！", "en": "Beware, Beholder."},
        {"zh": "肉地裂开，我睁开眼。", "en": "The flesh splits and I open my eye."},
        {"zh": "你的视线，我的猎物！", "en": "Your sight, my prey."},
        {"zh": "你触不到的威胁！", "en": "The threat you can't touch."},
        {"zh": "注视，直至绝望！", "en": "Gaze until despair."},
        {"zh": "肉地鼓起，眼睛睁开来", "en": "The flesh swells and an eye opens."},
        {"zh": "阴郁死地里亮起一点光", "en": "A point of light wakes in the gloomy deadland."},
        {"zh": "凝视丘陵上，多了一只眼", "en": "The gazing hills have gained another eye."},
        {"zh": "眼柄破土，缓缓转动", "en": "An eyestalk breaks the soil and slowly turns."}
